 quantity field (default 1) — `creates an order with custom quantity`\n19. Shipment quantity field (default 1) — `creates a shipment with custom quantity`\n20. Customer validation (422 error) — `returns 422 with error envelope for non-existent customer`\n21. Pagination limit/offset parameters — `validates limit parameter`, `validates offset parameter`, and equivalents for shipments and customers\n\n## Rows Uncovered\n\n1. GET /orders?fulfilment=STATUS&limit=L&offset=O | orders (list) — the ticket specifically requires filtering orders by fulfilment status, but no test exercises the `?fulfilment=STATUS` parameter\n2. GET /orders?fulfilment=STATUS&limit=L&offset=O | X-Total-Count header — no test exercises the X-Total-Count header in conjunction with the fulfilment filter\n\n## Additional Test Gaps\n\nThe following scenarios from the ticket are not tested:\n- Fulfilment status FULLY_ALLOCATED (only UNALLOCATED is tested)\n- Fulfilment status PARTIALLY_ALLOCATED (not tested)\n- Fulfilment status DELIVERED (not tested; the deliver transition is tested, but the order's fulfilment status after delivery is not verified)\n- Release of cancelled shipment's quantity (shipment cancellation is tested, but the effect on order fulfilment.allocated is not verified)\n- Fulfilment recalculation after quantity amendment with existing shipments (quantity update is tested, but only without shipments present)\n\n## Failing Tests\n\nNone. All 40 tests pass.\n\n## Verification\n\n**Command:** `cd /private/var/folders/jr/lwzz65cx5pndqqdgzhnym1pc0000gn/T/observatory-run-275d4cac-f43b-479d-bd46-ebb136e18e57/sample-service && ./mvnw test`\n\n**Result:** \n```\nTests run: 40, Failures: 0, Errors: 0, Skipped: 0\nBUILD SUCCESS\n```\n\nAll 40 tests pass. The uncovered rows are specifically the fulfilment filter feature (`GET /orders?fulfilment=STATUS`), which the ticket explicitly requires but has no test. The test suite also does not fully exercise all fulfilment statuses (FULLY_ALLOCATED, PARTIALLY_ALLOCATED, DELIVERED) or the cancellation-release scenario mentioned in the ticket's acceptance criteria.","usage":{"total_tokens":39124,"tool_uses":5,"duration_ms":142479},"uuid":"83f435cc-6c75-44f0-a9bc-af84d710d033","session_id":"ed641a0f-949a-40cd-8812-cb41c2b69a72"}
