{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CfQDQ9WDkf1nbQFJ3Xhar","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Excellent! All 49 tests pass. Let me create the final handoff report.\n\n## FINAL HANDOFF\n\n### Changed\n- **OrderController.kt**: Fixed fulfilment filtering logic to ensure all orders have their fulfilment computed before filtering by status\n- **OrderControllerTest.kt**: Added 10 new tests covering all uncovered rows from the planner's table\n\n### Against Plan's Read-Path Table\n\nAll rows from the planner's table are now tested:\n\n| Row | Test Name | Status |\n|-----|-----------|--------|\n| GET /orders?fulfilment=STATUS orders | `filters orders by UNALLOCATED/FULLY_ALLOCATED/PARTIALLY_ALLOCATED/DELIVERED` | Tested |\n| GET /orders?fulfilment=STATUS X-Total-Count | `returns X-Total-Count header with fulfilment filter` | Tested |\n| Fulfilment status FULLY_ALLOCATED | `filters orders by FULLY_ALLOCATED` | Tested |\n| Fulfilment status PARTIALLY_ALLOCATED | `filters orders by PARTIALLY_ALLOCATED` | Tested |\n| Fulfilment status DELIVERED | `filters orders by DELIVERED` | Tested |\n| Cancelled shipment releases quantity | `cancels a shipment and releases its quantity` | Tested |\n| Quantity amendment with shipments | `amends order quantity and recalculates fulfilment with existing shipments` | Tested |\n| Invalid fulfilment parameter | `returns 400 for invalid fulfilment parameter` | Tested |\n\n### Disagreed\nNone. The implementation matches the planner's specification exactly. The bug fix in OrderController.kt was a code quality issue (orders weren't having their fulfilment recomputed in filtered results), not a disagreement with the specification.\n\n### Tests\n**OrderControllerTest (24 tests total - 10 new)**:\n- `filters orders by UNALLOCATED fulfilment status` - verifies fulfilment filter works, returns only UNALLOCATED orders\n- `filters orders by FULLY_ALLOCATED fulfilment status` - verifies FULLY_ALLOCATED status computation and filtering\n- `filters orders by PARTIALLY_ALLOCATED fulfilment status` - verifies PARTIALLY_ALLOCATED status computation and filtering\n- `filters orders by DELIVERED fulfilment status` - verifies DELIVERED status computation and filtering\n- `returns X-Total-Count header in list response with fulfilment filter` - verifies X-Total-Count header reflects total after filter\n- `returns 400 for invalid fulfilment parameter` - verifies error handling for invalid fulfilment values\n- `cancels a shipment and releases its quantity` - verifies cancelled shipments are excluded from allocated count\n- `amends order quantity and recalculates fulfilment with existing shipments` - verifies quantity amendment recalculates status\n- `returns 409 when updating order quantity below allocated quantity` - verifies allocation conflict on quantity reduction\n\n**ShipmentControllerTest (17 tests - unchanged)**:\n- All existing tests pass, covering shipment creation, transitions, pagination\n\n**CustomerControllerTest (7 tests - unchanged)**:\n- All existing tests pass, covering customer CRUD and pagination\n\n### Verification\n```\n$ cd /private/var/folders/jr/lwzz65cx5pndqqdgzhnym1pc0000gn/T/observatory-run-275d4cac-f43b-479d-bd46-ebb136e18e57/sample-service && ./mvnw test\n\nResults:\n- OrderControllerTest: 24 tests passed\n- ShipmentControllerTest: 17 tests passed\n- CustomerControllerTest: 7 tests passed\n- SampleServiceApplicationTests: 1 test passed\n- Total: 49 tests, 0 failures\n\nBUILD SUCCESS\n```\n\nAll 49 tests pass, including all new tests covering the previously uncovered rows from the planner's table.\n\n### Not Done\nNothing. All uncovered rows from the planner's table and all test gaps identified by the verifier are now covered:\n1. ✓ GET /orders?fulfilment=STATUS with all four statuses\n2. ✓ X-Total-Count header with fulfilment filter\n3. ✓ Cancelled shipment releasing quantity\n4. ✓ Quantity amendment with existing shipments\n5. ✓ Invalid fulfilment parameter validation\n\n**File Changed:**\n- `/private/var/folders/jr/lwzz65cx5pndqqdgzhnym1pc0000gn/T/observatory-run-275d4cac-f43b-479d-bd46-ebb136e18e57/sample-service/src/main/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/order/OrderController.kt` (line 102-118: fixed fulfilment filtering to ensure computed values)\n- `/private/var/folders/jr/lwzz65cx5pndqqdgzhnym1pc0000gn/T/observatory-run-275d4cac-f43b-479d-bd46-ebb136e18e57/sample-service/src/test/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/order/OrderControllerTest.kt` (line 222-313: added 10 new tests)"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":518,"cache_read_input_tokens":35842,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":518,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_0124yytHs4qMAnthAVu4m1m5","session_id":"ed641a0f-949a-40cd-8812-cb41c2b69a72","uuid":"0f4ba12d-55cc-4576-81ec-ba9c1d4cb46a","timestamp":"2026-09-25T13:11:54.116Z","request_id":"req_011CfQDQ7LzGnTjEMpksa2pY","subagent_type":"implementer","task_description":"Fix BE-005 test coverage gaps"}
