n1. ✓ GET /orders?fulfilment=STATUS with all four statuses\n2. ✓ X-Total-Count header with fulfilment filter\n3. ✓ Cancelled shipment releasing quantity\n4. ✓ Quantity amendment with existing shipments\n5. ✓ Invalid fulfilment parameter validation\n\n**File Changed:**\n- `/private/var/folders/jr/lwzz65cx5pndqqdgzhnym1pc0000gn/T/observatory-run-275d4cac-f43b-479d-bd46-ebb136e18e57/sample-service/src/main/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/order/OrderController.kt` (line 102-118: fixed fulfilment filtering to ensure computed values)\n- `/private/var/folders/jr/lwzz65cx5pndqqdgzhnym1pc0000gn/T/observatory-run-275d4cac-f43b-479d-bd46-ebb136e18e57/sample-service/src/test/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/order/OrderControllerTest.kt` (line 222-313: added 10 new tests)","usage":{"total_tokens":37986,"tool_uses":8,"duration_ms":79721},"uuid":"d063d8c7-5948-451e-8171-f9feab27d1b8","session_id":"ed641a0f-949a-40cd-8812-cb41c2b69a72"}
