nt header in list response`\n\n**POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm response | status (CONFIRMED)** — `confirms a shipment` (ShipmentControllerTest)\n\n**POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/deliver response | status (DELIVERED)** — `delivers a shipment` (ShipmentControllerTest)\n\n**POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/cancel response | status (CANCELLED)** — `cancels a shipment` (ShipmentControllerTest)\n\n**Cancelled shipment releases quantity for new shipments** — `cancels a shipment and releases its quantity`\n\n**PUT /orders/{orderId}/quantity | order quantity amended** — `amends order quantity and recalculates fulfilment with existing shipments`\n\n**PUT /orders/{orderId}/quantity | fulfilment recalculated** — `amends order quantity and recalculates fulfilment with existing shipments`\n\n**GET /orders?fulfilment=INVALID | validation** — `returns 400 for invalid fulfilment parameter`\n\n**POST /orders with non-existent customerId** — `returns 422 with error envelope for non-existent customer`\n\n**GET /customers/{customerId} unknown customer | 404 error envelope** — `returns 404 with error envelope for an unknown customer` (CustomerControllerTest)\n\n**GET /shipments?limit=L&offset=O | pagination** — `lists shipments with pagination` (ShipmentControllerTest)\n\n**GET /shipments?limit=L&offset=O | X-Total-Count header** — `returns X-Total-Count header in shipment list` (ShipmentControllerTest)\n\n**GET /customers?limit=L&offset=O | pagination** — `lists customers with pagination` (CustomerControllerTest)\n\n**GET /customers?limit=L&offset=O | X-Total-Count header** — `returns X-Total-Count header in customer list` (CustomerControllerTest)\n\n## Rows uncovered\n\nNone.\n\n## Failing tests\n\nNone. All 49 tests pass.\n\n## Verification\n\nCommand run: `cd /private/var/folders/jr/lwzz65cx5pndqqdgzhnym1pc0000gn/T/observatory-run-275d4cac-f43b-479d-bd46-ebb136e18e57/sample-service && ./mvnw test`\n\nResult: **BUILD SUCCESS** — Tests run: 49, Failures: 0, Errors: 0, Skipped: 0\n\n